  "Attributes": [
    {
      "Id": 759823,
      "attributeType": "LongString",
      "attributeName": "AIDescription",
      "attributeRelationType": "None",
      "Value": "## 16 BIT XMAS 2011 - Christmas Craze (SNES)\n\nGet ready for a uniquely festive and chaotic experience with *Christmas Craze*, the first SNES homebrew game from RetroZone! Written by Shiru, this vibrant title throws you and up to three friends into a bizarre Christmas celebration. Dodge mischievous aliens while collecting presents, or engage in hilarious snowball fights in two-player present-picking battles. \n\nThe game's whimsical world is brought to life with colorful, blinking lights that frame the edges of the cartridge, creating a visually striking and immersive atmosphere. As you gather presents, witness a dazzling light show synchronized with the game's playful sound effects. Expect a lighthearted, slightly surreal adventure fueled by eggnog-induced revelry. *Christmas Craze* offers a charming blend of action, competition, and holiday cheer, perfect for a nostalgic trip back to the 16-bit era."
    },
